  "body": "Several Gopher/HTTP proxies exist. This change would allow them to register as a `gopher://` URL handler.\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/system-state.html#custom-handlers\r\n\r\n```diff\r\nbitcoin\r\ngeo\r\n+gopher\r\nim\r\nirc\r\nircs\r\nmagnet\r\nmailto\r\nmms\r\nnews\r\nnntp\r\nopenpgp4fpr\r\nsip\r\nsms\r\nsmsto\r\nssh\r\ntel\r\nurn\r\nwebcal\r\nwtai\r\nxmpp\r\n```\r\n",
